WEBVTT

00:00:00.873 --> 00:00:02.333
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Where</b> are you <b>from</b>?

00:00:04.755 --> 00:00:06.065
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>I’m</b> from <b>Toledo</b>.

00:00:08.453 --> 00:00:10.059
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Where’s Toledo?</b>

00:00:12.339 --> 00:00:13.506
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s in <b>Spain</b>.